6px;\">Shop for the family</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;\">Warmly,<br>Comfort Fresh<br><span style=\"color:#666666;font-size:14px;\">brand@comfortfresh.shop</span></p></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 32px;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;text-align:center;color:#777777;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><strong>Comfort Fresh</strong> by All About Socks, LLC</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\">2929 N Main Street, N Logan, UT 84341 \u00b7 USA</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\"><a href=\"[[unsubscribe_link]]\" style=\"color:#555555;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://comfort-fresh.com/policies/privacy-policy\" style=\"color:#555555;text-decoration:underline;\">Privacy Policy</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://comfort-fresh.com/policies/terms-of-service\" style=\"color:#555555;text-decoration:underline;\">Terms of Service</a></p></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>"}, "bundle_clock": {"name": "CF \u00b7 Bundle restock \u00b7 v1", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Comfort Fresh</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5f5;\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;\">Your bundle is about three months old. Time for fresh pairs?</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f5f5f5;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:16px 8px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222222;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 8px;text-align:center;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#0d5c45;\">Comfort Fresh</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;color:#666666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\">Wide, non-binding bamboo socks for everyday comfort</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 32px 28px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:#222222;\">Hi [[contact.first_name]],</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#222222;\">You bought a big pack a few months ago. Bamboo socks stay soft, but heels and toes thin out with daily wear, usually around the three-month mark.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#222222;\">Restocking takes a minute: the <strong>same style and size</strong>, and the 18 and 24-pair packs now include <strong>free Wild Habitat printed insoles</strong>.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://comfort-fresh.com/products/bamboo-diabetic-ankle\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0556/9468/8343/files/combo-20261017_021548_5e23fbc7-9d16-44fc-be3e-1c4d95ad0607.png?v=1792203971\" alt=\"Widest Non-Binding Ankle Socks\" width=\"536\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:536px;height:auto;border:0;display:block;margin:0 auto;\"></a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#222222;\"><strong>12 pairs $79 \u00b7 18 pairs $109 \u00b7 24 pairs $129.</strong> The 18 and 24-pair packs include <strong>free Wild Habitat printed insoles</strong>, and shipping is free over $50.</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0 12px;text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://comfort-fresh.com/products/bamboo-diabetic-ankle\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0d5c45;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;\">Restock my socks</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;\">Warmly,<br>Comfort Fresh<br><span style=\"color:#666666;font-size:14px;\">brand@comfortfresh.shop</span></p></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 32px;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;text-align:center;color:#777777;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"